headers {
  Authorization: API-Token {{apiToken}}
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # Scratch API

  A testing collection for the Scratch REST API. Every request inherits the
  collection-level `Authorization: API-Token {{apiToken}}` header above, which
  authenticates against the server's `APITokenStrategy`.

  1. Pick an environment (Local / Test / Production) from the top-right selector.
  2. Set the secret `apiToken` variable for that environment (see README.md for
     how to mint one).
  3. Fill in path variables ({{workbookId}}, {{connectorAccountId}}, ...) for the
     request you want to run.

  See README.md in this folder for full setup instructions, the list of path
  variables, and notes on the CLI / Internal groups (which use extra headers).
}
